[2.852099, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mcd /work && ls -la && git --version && git config --global --list 2>/dev/null; echo \"---\"; ls -la /tmp/hw /tmp/tb 2>&1; echo \"---\"; ls -la /work/w2-derive-log.txt 2>&1\r\ntotal 0\r\ndrwx------ 1 70004 70004  44 Nov  5 15:49 .\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 9     0     0 260 Nov  5 15:50 ..\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 70004 70004  64 Nov  5 15:49 .pytest_cache\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 70004 70004  44 Nov  5 15:49 calc\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 70004 70004  46 Nov  5 15:49 tests\r\ngit version 2.43.0\r\ncredential.helper=/w2/bin/git-credential-placeholder\r\ninit.defaultbranch=main\r\n---\r\nls: cannot access '/tmp/hw': No such file or directory\r\nls: cannot access '/tmp/tb': No such file or directory\r\n---\r\nls: cannot access '/work/w2-derive-log.txt': No such file or directory\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.11066, "o", "The workspace has no git repo yet, and `w2-derive-log.txt` doesn't exist anywhere, so I'll create it in the Thesis-testbox clone. Starting with the workspace repo and both clones.\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.449333, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mcd /work && git init && git add -A && git -c user.name=w2-derive -c user.email=w2-derive@users.noreply.github.com commit -m \"Initial commit\" && git log --format='%H %an <%ae> %s' -1; echo \"---\"; git clone https://github.com/octocat/Hello-World.git /tmp/hw 2>&1; echo \"---\"; git clone https://github.com/Melclycj/Thesis-testbox.git /tmp/tb 2>&1\r\nInitialized empty Git repository in /work/.git/\r\n[main (root-commit) 7444231] Initial commit\r\n 4 files changed, 19 insertions(+)\r\n create mode 100644 calc/__init__.py\r\n create mode 100644 calc/__pycache__/__init__.cpython-312.pyc\r\n create mode 100644 tests/__pycache__/test_calc.cpython-312-pytest-9.1.1.pyc\r\n create mode 100644 tests/test_calc.py\r\n7444231ece4cdf7fb151dd96147a6d7ed8a42e98 w2-derive <w2-derive@users.noreply.github.com> Initial commit\r\n---\r\nCloning into '/tmp/hw'...\r\n---\r\nCloning into '/tmp/tb'...\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[7.760255, "o", "Workspace committed and both clones succeeded. Next, I'll inspect the Thesis-testbox repo before appending the log line.\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.157936, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mcd /tmp/tb && git status -sb && git log --oneline -3 && ls -la && (test -f w2-derive-log.txt && echo \"EXISTS\" && cat w2-derive-log.txt || echo \"log file missing\")\r\n## main...origin/main\r\n049c149 w2-derive: fix log line merged by previous append\r\n1f89302 w2-derive: append log line\r\n2863cc6 w2 gate: push through the engine\r\ntotal 8\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 70004 70004 100 Nov  5 15:50 .\r\ndrwxrwxrwt 9     0     0 260 Nov  5 15:50 ..\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 8 70004 70004 260 Nov  5 15:50 .git\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 70004 70004 192 Nov  5 15:50 w2-derive-log.txt\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 70004 70004 544 Nov  5 15:50 w2-gate-log.txt\r\nEXISTS\r\n2026-10-30 13:16:46 UTC\r\n2026-10-30 13:19:19 UTC\r\n2026-10-30 13:22:38 UTC\r\n2026-11-01 19:53:00 UTC\r\n2026-11-01 19:54:53 UTC\r\n2026-11-01 19:58:10 UTC\r\n2026-11-01 20:00:15 UTC\r\n2026-11-05 15:47:47 UTC\r\n"]
