[14.924686, "o", "All steps are done.\r\n\r\n- **Workspace (`/work`)**: `git init` and committed all files as `7444231` (author `w2-derive <w2-derive@users.noreply.github.com>`). That includes two `__pycache__/*.pyc` files, since you asked for all files. Say if you want them ignored and removed from the commit.\r\n- **Hello-World**: cloned to `/tmp/hw`. No commit or push was requested there.\r\n- **Thesis-testbox**: cloned to `/tmp/tb`. I appended `2026-11-05 15:50:23 UTC` to `w2-derive-log.txt` and committed it as `0d318ed` with the same author. `git push` succeeded: `049c149..0d318ed main -> main`.\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
